{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextArea"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"]},{"content":[{"text":"Layout","anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text area is based on several configurable UI elements:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"label","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the text area.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In some UI contexts, especially when space is limited or when the text area is part of a compact layout, the label can be hidden.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, hiding the label should only be done if the purpose remains clear thanks to a placeholder or contextual icon","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and if the label is still accessible to screen readers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Hiding a label is a design choice that must balance visual simplicity and clarity of intent, without compromising inclusiveness or form guidance.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"placeholder","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": If the text of the text area is empty a placeholder provides a hint or guidance inside the field to suggest expected input.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Status","anchor":"Status","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Five status are proposed for all layouts:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"enabled (by default)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Default neutral appearance, whether empty or filled.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It allows users to click, focus, and type freely without restrictions.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"error","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"error","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status indicates that the user input does not meet validation rules or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"expected formatting. It provides immediate visual feedback, typically through a red border,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an error icon, and a clear, accessible error message positioned below the text area. The error message replaces the helper text.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"loading","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"loading","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" state indicates that the system is processing or retrieving data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"related to the text entered. A progress indicator appears to inform the user that an action is in progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The field remains editable while loading.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"readOnly","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"code":"readOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status lets the text visible but not editable.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"disabled","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": In ","type":"text"},{"code":"disabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status, the field is non-interactive and grayed out to indicate it cannot be changed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Note the SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"code":"View.disabled()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ignored.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper text (plain)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A supporting text conveys additional information about the text area,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"such as how it will be used. It should ideally only take up a single line, though may wrap","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to multiple lines if required, and be either persistently visible or visible only on focus.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper text (characters max count)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Uses an internal message displaying the count of remaining characters depending to the given value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is a specific iOS library feature with 1.4.0","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper link","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": If the helper text is not sufficient, it’s possible to offer the user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an additional help link (the link can be external or open a modal).","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default no haptics are done by the component."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However you should think about cases where you will have to make the devices vibrate."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can refer to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Mandatory field indication","anchor":"Mandatory-field-indication","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields are mandatory” at the top of your formular."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Do not use an asterisk at the end of each field label, nor the word “mandatory.”"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If not all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields marked with an * are mandatory” at the top of your formular."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use an asterisk (*) at the end of each mandatory field label, and ensures this is well vocalized."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UI rendering of the asterisk must be done with "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"bold font weight","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"negative content color","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (red on light backgrounds)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mention “(optional)” at the end of each optional field label. Note that this rule is not systematic, it remains an option, to be used if needed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is only one field in the formular, or if the mandatory nature is obvious,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no mention is necessary since the fields are essential to the formular’s functionality."}]},{"text":"Outlined style","anchor":"Outlined-style","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area uses a subtle background fill and a bottom border only, creating a softer and more contained look."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"outlined","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area uses a transparent background and a visible stroke on all four sides."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This style may be appropriate for contexts where inputs need to feel lightweight and unobtrusive,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for example inside a card, a dialog, or a filtering panel."}]},{"code":["    \/\/ An outlined text area","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Fixed height","anchor":"Fixed-height","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the text area grows vertically as the user types, up to a maximum height defined by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"design system (token "},{"code":"sizeMaxHeightInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). Once that height is reached, the content becomes scrollable."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"code":"constrainedMaxHeight","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is set to "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the maximum height is capped to the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"minimum","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" height"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(token "},{"code":"sizeMinHeightInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), keeping the component at a fixed, compact size at all times."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The content is immediately scrollable from the first overflow line."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is useful in dense layouts — forms, filter panels, chat composers — where vertical space is at a premium."}]},{"code":["    \/\/ Height is fixed to the minimum (no vertical growth)","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}]},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["    \/\/ The text to display and edit","    @State var text: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ Empty text and no placeholder","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text)","","    \/\/ Empty text with placeholder","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\")","","    \/\/ With a plain helper text","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 placeholder: \"Describe your issue in detail\",","                 helperText: .plain(\"Maximum 500 characters.\"))","","    \/\/ With a maximum character count — the component shows \"X characters remaining\" (bold)","    \/\/ and switches to an error style when exceeded.","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\",","                 text: $text,","                 helperText: .charactersMaxCount(500))","","    \/\/ With helper link","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openUrl","","    let helperLink = OUDSTextArea.Helperlink(text: \"Helper Link\") {","       openUrl.callAsFunction(url)","    }","","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Placeholder\", helperLink: helperLink)","","    \/\/ With error status","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, status: .error(message: \"This field can't be empty.\"))","","    \/\/ Outlined style","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)","","    \/\/ Fixed height — no vertical growth","    OUDSTextArea(label: \"Comments\", text: $text, constrainedMaxHeight: true)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-text-area","isActive":true}]},{"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_Orange"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_OrangeCompact"}]},{"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_Sosh"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_textArea_Wireframe"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Version","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}]},{"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.4.0","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/Helperlink"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/init(label:text:placeholder:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:constrainedMaxHeight:status:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/body"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/HelperText","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/Status"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextarea"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea"},"abstract":[{"text":"Text area is a UI element that allows to type, edit, or select longer blocks of textual data, such as comments, messages or descriptions;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by expanding vertically and offering more space to input text.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and i